{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to follow and join us:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bilibili: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Red Book: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QQ Group: 1022200878</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first-person exploration and puzzle-solving psychological horror game. Set in retro Chinese &quot;dreamcore&quot; environments, players will unravel mysteries step by step to uncover the truth of a case. Assuming the role of Chen Han, a community police officer, you\u2019ll investigate a child disappearance case that occurred over a decade ago. As the investigation deepens, the case grows increasingly strange\u2014what exactly is the truth? Players must search for clues in scenes like old courtyards, offices, and corridors, while avoiding pursuit to piece together the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a first-person 3D perspective with a PSX-era retro art style, rooted in early 2000s China. Its nostalgic, dreamlike Chinese aesthetics aim to evoke familiarity and warmth, immersing players in a world that feels both intimate and eerie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Scene Graphics:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/01.gif?t=1746004909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/02.gif?t=1746004909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/extras/03.gif?t=1746004909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WSAD to control movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">E to interact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shift to sprint</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space to jump</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">F to use flashlight</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3643430?t=1746004909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/ee10aebf93cc6c20bb408c78f0e36618b6785613/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746004909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/b772593e1cac1563fb842027ae9283c43d45507e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746004909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3643430/b772593e1cac1563fb842027ae9283c43d45507e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746004909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Welcome to follow and join us:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bilibili: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9\u513f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Little Red Book: \u65e7\u662f\u73a9</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">QQ Group: 1022200878</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Introduction\uff1a</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first-person exploration and puzzle-solving psychological horror game. Set in retro Chinese &quot;dreamcore&quot; environments, players will unravel mysteries step by step to uncover the truth of a case. Assuming the role of Chen Han, a community police officer, you\u2019ll investigate a child disappearance case that occurred over a decade ago. As the investigation deepens, the case grows increasingly strange\u2014what exactly is the truth? Players must search for clues in scenes like old courtyards, offices, and corridors, while avoiding pursuit to piece together the mystery.</p><p cla